flowchart TD
    A[Document uploaded] --> B[pdf_service: page text via PyMuPDF, OCR fallback via Tesseract]
    B --> C[chunk_service.clean_text - normalize spaces, de-hyphenate]
    C --> D[Split page into blocks at strict headings - ALL CAPS or Title Case, max 8 words]
    D --> E{Any block >= 40 chars?}
    E -->|yes| F[Sections with heading as section_title]
    E -->|no| G[Fallback: whole page text becomes one section - no content is ever dropped]
    F --> H[_split_long: sections longer than 1600 chars split at sentence boundaries]
    G --> H
    H --> I[table_service tables added as content_type=table sections]
    I --> J[embedding_service.embed_texts - batches of 16]
    J --> K[Ollama /api/embed nomic-embed-text:latest -> 768-dim vectors]
    K --> L[vector_store.add_sections - L2-normalize, FAISS IndexFlatIP, embeddings kept in JSON sidecar]
    L --> M[(sections.faiss + sections_meta.json on disk)]

    N[User question] --> O[embedding_service.embed_query -> question vector]
    O --> P[vector_store.search - inner product = cosine similarity, fetch top k*5]
    P --> Q[Filter by document_ids if given]
    Q --> R[Drop results below MIN_RETRIEVAL_SCORE 0.35, keep top-k 8]
    R --> S{Any section left?}
    S -->|no| T[REFUSAL - exact sentence, model is never called]
    S -->|yes| U[retrieval_service.build_context - numbered Source blocks, page numbers, OCR flag, max 12000 chars]
    U --> V[ANSWER_PROMPT: rules + evidence + question -> qwen2.5:1.5b at temperature 0]
    V --> W[Parse Answer / Evidence status]
    W --> X[verification_service.verify: every number in answer must exist in evidence or page numbers]
    X --> Y[citation_service.build_sources: citations only from retrieved sections - model cannot invent pages]
    Y --> Z[Final ChatResponse with evidence_status, sources, verification warnings]
